flowchart TB
    FAIL[IAM unavailable]
    FAIL --> NEW[New assignment: paused / queued]
    FAIL --> CHG[Role change: paused]
    FAIL --> REV[Normal revocation: paused / contingency if required]

    EU[Existing user] --> DIR[Enterprise Directory available]
    DIR --> PLT[Enterprise Platform available]
    PLT --> OK[Existing governed access continues]